{0 atproto}

{!Atproto} is a typed OCaml client for the
{{:https://atproto.com}AT Protocol}. Resolve identities, read and write
repos, follow the firehose, and call AppView, Ozone, and hosted Bluesky
services (chat, video, Jetstream). Client only: this package does not
host a PDS, chat backend, video transcoder, Tap, SMS gateway, or
APNs/FCM.

Install, env, and examples:
{{:https://github.com/david-engelmann/atproto#atproto}README}.
Release notes:
{{:https://github.com/david-engelmann/atproto/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md}CHANGELOG}.

{1 Install}

{v
opam update && opam install atproto
v}

Then [(libraries atproto)] in dune. OCaml [>= 4.14.1] and [< 5.4]
(CI: 4.14.1 and 5.3.0). Jetstream dict-zstd needs system libzstd
([libzstd-dev] / Homebrew [zstd]). Pin the GitHub repo or a local
clone for an unreleased tip.

{1 Quick start}

These two calls need the public network, not [ATP_AUTH].
[Identity.resolve_handle] talks to the entryway ([ATP_HOST],
default [bsky.social]). [Feed.search_posts] talks to the public
AppView ([public.api.bsky.app]). [ATP_PUBLIC] only gates {e tests},
not this snippet.

{[
let did = (Identity.resolve_handle "jay.bsky.team").did
let posts = Feed.search_posts ~q:"atproto" ~limit:5 ()
]}

{1 Where to go next}

{ul
{- Resolve a handle or DID: {!Atproto.Identity}}
{- App-password session: {!Atproto.Session} and {!Atproto.Auth}}
{- Profiles and timelines: {!Atproto.Feed} and {!Atproto.Actor}}
{- Write a post or follow: {!Atproto.Records} and {!Atproto.Repo}}
{- Firehose / Jetstream: {!Atproto.Firehose} and {!Atproto.Jetstream}}
{- Browser login: {!Atproto.Oauth}. You host [client-metadata.json].
   DPoP cannot be proxied.}
{- Hosted chat or video: {!Atproto.Chat} and {!Atproto.Video}}}

{1 Modules}

Identity. Handle and DID resolve, PLC, [did:web] / [did:key].

{!modules: Atproto.Identity Atproto.Did_plc Atproto.Did_web Atproto.Did_key}

Session. App passwords, invites, email, [getServiceAuth].

{!modules: Atproto.Auth Atproto.Session Atproto.Server}

AppView. Profiles, timelines, search, graphs, bookmarks, public
labelers.

{!modules: Atproto.Actor Atproto.Feed Atproto.Graph Atproto.Bookmark Atproto.Labeler Atproto.Unspecced}

Records. create/put/delete/applyWrites and typed post / like / follow
builders.

{!modules: Atproto.Repo Atproto.Records Atproto.Embed Atproto.Facet}

Firehose. [subscribeRepos] and Jetstream live tail / archive HTTP.

{!modules: Atproto.Firehose Atproto.Websocket Atproto.Jetstream}

OAuth. PKCE, DPoP, public HTTPS client-metadata, browser login. You
still host the metadata document. Authed AppView / Ozone / chat use
[Oauth.get_service_auth], not the DPoP access token.

{!modules: Atproto.Oauth Atproto.Oauth_scope}

Hosted clients. Chat ([api.bsky.chat]; extra DM scopes), video
([video.bsky.app]; no transcoder), contacts (no SMS gateway),
[registerPush] (caller gateway).

{!modules: Atproto.Chat Atproto.Video Atproto.Contact Atproto.Notification}

Ozone and reports.

{!modules: Atproto.Ozone Atproto.Admin Atproto.Temp Atproto.Moderation}

Sync and indexer. Repo CAR, MST, CID. {!Atproto.Repo_sync} is a
backfill toolkit, not a Tap host.

{!modules: Atproto.Sync Atproto.Repo_sync Atproto.Mst Atproto.Cid Atproto.Car Atproto.Dag_cbor}

Protocol bits. [at://], TIDs, XRPC, lexicons, labels, HTTP.

{!modules: Atproto.At_uri Atproto.Tid Atproto.Syntax Atproto.Xrpc Atproto.Error Atproto.Lexicon Atproto.Label Atproto.Http_client}

Also {!Atproto.Draft}, {!Atproto.Ageassurance}, {!Atproto.Site},
{!Atproto.Germnetwork}, {!Atproto.App}, {!Atproto.Client},
{!Atproto.Request}, and {!Atproto.Response}.

Experimental proposal
{{:https://github.com/bluesky-social/proposals/blob/main/0016-permissioned-data/README.md}0016}
([At_uri.Space] plus the modules below). Not a spaces
product API. No space host in this package.

{!modules: Atproto.Lt_hash Atproto.Space_commit Atproto.Space_credential Atproto.Space_xrpc Atproto.Space_sync}

{1 Notes}

Live public-network tests skip unless [ATP_PUBLIC=1]. Default
[opam install -t] / [@runtest] stay offline.

Official lexicons are pinned at
{{:https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto/commit/f0d4877a03dc8ede0d3e9a36d5b72ada63b5d2e0}[f0d4877a]}.

{!Atproto.Chat} needs a DM grant ([transition:chat.bsky] or
[include:chat.bsky.authFullChatClient], or a privileged app-password).
{!Atproto.Jetstream} archive HTTP needs an operator
[JETSTREAM_API_KEY]; live [subscribe] stays unauthenticated. Space
helpers skip unless [ATP_SPACE=1] and [ATP_SPACE_HOST] names a real
host.
